  "snippet": "Some people tell you exactly what they want for the holidays, but some people just don’t. The gifts, the decor, the food, for all of it, you have to guess at what they might like. You trawl thousands of gift guide lists ...",
  "coverImage": "https://github.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Universe-4-4.jpg?resize=1024%2C576",
  "readTime": 1,
  "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Some people tell you exactly what they want for the holidays, but some people just don’t. The gifts, the decor, the food, for all of it, you have to guess at what they might like. You trawl thousands of gift guide lists titled “the definitive gift guide for 2026,” but none of the guides are quite right for that special person. That is, until this one came along.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As long as that person in your life is a developer.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We won’t say it’s the definitive guide for the developer in your life (or for yourself, we won’t judge), but we have brought together a few of our favorite pieces from the GitHub Shop for you to pick from.</p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-3e41869c wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/holiday-gift-guides\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Shop the gift guides</a></div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"Photo of a hand building a GitHub-themed keyboard.\" class=\"wp-image-100444\" height=\"576\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://github.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Universe-4-4.jpg?resize=1024%2C576\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-get-building\">Get building</h2>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At GitHub Universe this year we brought our brand new <a href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/busy-builders/products/github-x-omnitype-bauer-lite-keyboard-kit\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub x Omnitype Bauer Lite Keyboard Kit</a> to the Makerspace for our attendees to build. To say it was popular is an understatement. If you like building keyboards, you’ll want the details. Each GitHub-exclusive Bauer Lite kit arrives in a randomly selected color combination and includes a hot-swap PCB with RGB underglow, Omnitype Hawk linear switches, dye-sublimated PBT keycaps, and the essential hardware and tools for a hands-on custom build. And if you’re new to building keyboards then you can follow along with our step-by-step guide.</p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<div class=\"mod-vh position-relative\">\n</div>\n</div></figure>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you like building of a different variety, perhaps our new <a href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/busy-builders/products/500-piece-jigsaw-puzzle\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub jigsaw puzzle</a> will be calling you. Grab yourself a hot beverage, settle in, and start building. Speaking of which…</p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-3e41869c wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/busy-builders\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Busy builders gift guide</a></div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"A man wears a &lt;dark mode&gt; eye mask, GitHub t-shirt, and holds a GitHub blanket.\" class=\"wp-image-100445\" height=\"576\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://github.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Universe-17.jpg?resize=1024%2C576\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-get-cozy\">Get cozy</h2>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If the preference is to work on the sofa in ultimate comfort, then this is the gift guide for you. Drape a <a href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/cozy-coders/products/woven-throw-blanket\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">cozy blanket</a> over you, put on some <a href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/cozy-coders/products/fuzzy-patterned-crew-socks\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">warm socks</a>, and while your agent is busy at work you can slip on the <a href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/cozy-coders/products/dark-mode-sleep-mask\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">sleep mask</a> and have a little mid-afternoon nap.</p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-3e41869c wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/cozy-coders\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cozy coders gift guide</a></div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"Photo of a Mona bobble head.\" class=\"wp-image-100446\" height=\"576\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://github.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Universe-2-5.jpg?resize=1024%2C576\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-get-decorating\">Get decorating</h2>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If the desk of you or your loved one is looking a bit dull, brighten it up with a <a href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/desk-decorators/products/1540443-00-recycled-desk-mat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">colorful desk mat</a>, selection of <a href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/desk-decorators/products/1548074-00-ship-it-diner-mug\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mugs</a> and <a href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/desk-decorators/products/1547137-00-invertocat-disco-tumbler\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tumblers</a>, and two buddies to help with all your coding decisions. The <a href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/desk-decorators/products/github-copilot-amazeball\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Copilot Amazeball</a> sits on your desk until you have a burning question. Should you ship on a Friday? Give the Amazeball a shake, turn it over, and get your answer. Your other tiny teammate, the <a href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/desk-decorators/products/mona-octocat-bobblehead\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Mona Octobobble</a>, will simply nod along to all your best ideas. Of which, we’re certain, there are many.</p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-3e41869c wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/desk-decorators\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Desk decorators gift guide</a></div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"Photo of a person wearing an ASCII art t-shirt holding a GitHub skateboard.\" class=\"wp-image-100447\" height=\"576\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://github.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Universe-20.jpg?resize=1024%2C576\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-get-traveling\">Get traveling</h2>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If your January resolution is to become a digital nomad then there are gifts here for you, too, especially if you have all the ideas but no gear. From <a href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/well-traveled-dev/products/tech-organizer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tech organizers</a> to <a href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/well-traveled-dev/products/work-tote\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">work totes</a> to <a href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/well-traveled-dev/products/1542211-00-github-skateboard-deck\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">awesome skateboards</a>, we’ll get you where you need to go in style.</p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-3e41869c wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/well-traveled-dev\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Well-traveled devs gift guide</a></div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"A woman wearing a black-and-white GitHub jacket.\" class=\"wp-image-100448\" height=\"576\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://github.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Universe-21.jpeg?resize=1024%2C576\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-super-fans-unite\">Super fans unite</h2>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Super fans, check out some of our most popular items from the shop, like our <a href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/github-superfans/products/invertocat-hoodie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">classic invertocat hoodie</a>. Plus get your hands on the <a href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/github-superfans/products/hoodie-can-coozie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">matching version for your drink</a>.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Cold outside? Then dress up your outfit with our <a href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/github-superfans/products/gh-varsity-jacket\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Mona Varsity jacket</a>. Too warm for that? Then you’ll love our <a href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/github-superfans/products/mascot-cabana-top\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cabana shirt</a> and <a href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/github-superfans/products/mascot-cabana-shorts\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">shorts</a> co-ord.</p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-3e41869c wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/github-superfans\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub super fans gift guide</a></div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"The Mona bestie bottle.\" class=\"wp-image-100449\" height=\"576\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://github.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Universe-2-6.jpg?resize=1024%2C576\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-something-for-the-next-generation\">Something for the next generation</h2>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Whether it’s for a brand-new baby or the tweenager just getting into coding, we have something for all ages. Start them off with the <a href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/next-gen-devs/products/ascii-invertocat-onesie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Invertocat onesie</a> and move on into the matching <a href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/next-gen-devs/products/mona-bestie-bottle\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Mona bestie bottle</a> and <a href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/next-gen-devs/products/gh-0008-plush-octocat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Mona plush</a>.</p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-3e41869c wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/collections/next-gen-devs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Next-gen devs gift guide</a></div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"Photo of a plushie Mona.\" class=\"wp-image-100450\" height=\"576\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://github.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Universe-19.jpg?resize=1024%2C576\" width=\"1024\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Github Universe 2025</figcaption></figure>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-shipping-fees-404-not-found\">Shipping fees? 404 Not Found.</h2>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We have a special Black Friday deal for you: Use code FREESHIPBLOG26 for free standard shipping through December 1, 2026 and ensure your gifts arrive by December 22 by checking out our <a href=\"https://thegithubshop.com/pages/shopping-info\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">holiday shipping deadlines.</a> Happy shopping!</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://github.blog/news-insights/company-news/these-are-the-gifts-developers-will-actually-want/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">These are the gifts developers will actually want</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://github.blog\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">The GitHub Blog</a>.</p>",
